PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786061888
OL,3,CTeenagers overwhelmingly likely to
OL,4,Cturn off optional social media curfews
OL,5,C` poll
OL,7,FThen-education secretary Bridget
OL,8,FPhillipson suggested the voluntary
OL,9,Felement to curfews could be changed if
OL,10,Fit was found many teenagers were
OL,11,Fswitching off the default settings.
OL,13,FA report published last month by Meta
OL,14,Falso found that 90% of teenagers had
OL,15,Fkept content restrictions applied to
OL,16,Ftheir accounts last October in place.
OL,18,FA Government spokesperson said: "Young
OL,19,Fpeople will have a choice in how they
OL,20,Fnavigate social media as they grow
OL,21,Finto adulthood.
OL,26,@zD@aOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
