OL,3,CTeenagers overwhelmingly likely to
OL,4,Cturn off optional social media curfews
OL,5,C` poll
OL,7,FMunira Wilson, the Liberal Democrats'
OL,8,Feducation spokeswoman, criticised the
OL,9,FGovernment's approach, calling for
OL,10,Fpolicymakers to "tackle the causes of
OL,11,Fsocial media addiction, not just the
OL,12,Fsymptoms".
OL,14,FShe said: "You wouldn't give an
OL,15,Falcoholic a bottle of wine with a
OL,16,Fscrew cap and call it a preventative
OL,17,Fmeasure, so why is this Government
OL,18,Fdoing the digital equivalent for young
OL,19,Fpeople online?"
OL,26,@rD@QOUtD@IO]vD@KOU{D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
