PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786061888
OL,3,CTeenagers overwhelmingly likely to
OL,4,Cturn off optional social media curfews
OL,5,C` poll
OL,7,FMs Wilson added: "The Liberal
OL,8,FDemocrats are calling for film-style
OL,9,Fage ratings, allowing young people to
OL,10,Fenjoy the best of the online world
OL,11,Fwhile giving social media companies a
OL,12,Fclear incentive to remove addictive
OL,13,Fdesign features and harmful content
OL,14,Ffrom their platforms.
OL,16,F"Our message is simple ` if your
OL,17,Fplatform is designed to drive
OL,18,Faddiction, you don't get access to our
OL,19,Fchildren."
OL,26,@oD@ROUxD@AOU{D@JO]
